{"t": "2026-10-06T12:28:40", "stage": "A1", "verb": "log", "args": ["A1a closes with the checks, the screen and the order written: census and analysed set 705, nothing dropped, six defects and two departures, the self-test clean. The contrast is early (h0 to 3, 131 rooms) against late (after h48, 61 rooms), carried with a held-size comparison because size differs a hundredfold; concept_reach_threshold is 0 pending QA1-001. Next is A1b-01, block 01, starting with the room mem.py next names (anarchism)."], "opts": {"kind": "note"}, "offset": 0, "limit": 80, "lines": 1, "total": 1, "refused": null}
